/* ---------- a list from a pill: the iPhone's menu (10 November, 00:32) ----------
   The owner: «Выпадающий список из пилюли надо сделать другим, пилюля закругленная, а выпадающий список квадратный —
   странно». On a computer a list opens as the iPhone's and the Mac's menus: a layer rounded at 14, a little see-through,
   a thin edge and a soft shadow; its rows 44 high with a hair between them; the chosen one ticked at the left, nothing
   filled — the row under the pointer lit grey. On a phone it stays the sheet from the bottom (92-office-grid.css), its
   chosen row ticked, not filled. */
@keyframes menu-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.97) translateY(-4px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
