   accent's), the demo's two papers two cells, the alerts bands; «Недавние фото» rows, their states quiet words */
.front-look .scan-pick > .scan-take { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 0; margin: 0 calc(-1 * var(--edge)); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 0 var(--zl), inset 0 -1px 0 0 var(--zl); }
